<title>BELGIUM: No Eurostar before Saturday - Belgian railways.</title>
<headline>No Eurostar before Saturday - Belgian railways.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Eurostar passenger train service through the Channel Tunnel is unlikely to resume before Saturday November 30, Belgian SNCB/NMBS railways said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tunnel has been closed to passenger trains for a week after a fire in a freight wagon that caused extensive damage to one of the two main tunnels. Freight services resumed last Thursday.</p>
<p>SNCB/NMBS said earlier it was considering suing Eurotunnel SA/Plc for damages</p>
<p>Belgian radio said on Monday it now appeared that a full service may not be resumed for up to six months.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
